I remember a bunch of games where I reached the Castle drawbridge and I
knew the tune.  Some games I had an instrument.  Some I did not have an
instrument.  Most I had other means to open the drawbridge or go around
to the back gate.

I have tried using an instrument to smash monsters.  It is very nice
when there are mind flayers in the court.  It doesn't work as well for
teleporting liches but I'll take what I can get.  A lot of items end up
rusted in the moat water.  Maybe I'll be willing to spend a scroll of
earth to fill the moat on both sides to retrieve the items.


